    ["<Assistant_Title1>【礼金 - 金镑礼金】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>2级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</>在<Assistant_System>聊天 - 对应频道右下角 - 礼金按钮</>可以发放不同频道的礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>发放频道：</>在队伍/团队频道、俱乐部频道、语音房间内，可以发放对应金镑礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>广播礼金：</>使用心羽·神谕广播和迅电·神谕广播，可以发送全服跑马灯广播，并附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>礼金消耗：</>消耗非绑金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金。\n<Assistant_Title2>运势礼金：</>无密钥，其他玩家可以直接领取，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>密语礼金：</>需要语音输入正确的密语才可以领取礼金，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>密钥礼金：</>需要输入正确的密码才可以领取礼金，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gift Money - Gold Pound Gift Money】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Chat - bottom right of the corresponding channel - Gift Money button</>, you can distribute gift money in different channels.\n<Assistant_Title2>Distribution Channels: </>You can distribute corresponding Gold Pound gift money in Team/Group channels, Club channels, and voice rooms.\n<Assistant_Title2>Broadcast Gift Money: </>Use Heart Feather Oracle Broadcast and Lightning Oracle Broadcast to send server-wide marquee broadcasts, with half the value of Bound Gold Pound gift money for the World channel attached.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gift Money Consumption: </>Consuming non-bound Gold Pounds allows you to send Bound Gold Pound gift money; claiming gift money grants equivalent Bound Gold Pounds. 24 hours after Bound Gold Pound gift money is sent, unclaimed gift money will be returned as equivalent Bound Gold Pounds.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fortune Gift Money: </>No key required, other players can claim it directly, and after claiming, they will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Whisper Gift Money: </>Requires voice input of the correct whisper to claim the gift money, and after claiming, you will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Key Gift Money: </>Requires entering the correct password to claim the gift money, and after claiming, you will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蠕动的饥饿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，攻击主目标时有概率剥离其灵魂，吞噬后按目标类别获得<Assistant_Red>攻击</>、<Assistant_Red>防御</>、<Assistant_Red>移速</>、<Assistant_Red>穿透</>等增益，并对灵魂主人造成伤害和<Assistant_Red>虚弱</>效果；吞噬效果持续期间若未能击杀目标，自身会受到反噬并扣除最大生命值。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Creeping Hunger] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Attack-type Sealed Artifact \n <Assistant_Title2> Details: </> General-purpose Sealed Artifact. When attacking the main target, there is a chance to strip its soul. After devouring it, gain buffs such as <Assistant_Red> Attack </>, <Assistant_Red> Defense </>, <Assistant_Red> Movement Speed </>, and <Assistant_Red> Penetration </> based on the target's category, and deal damage and apply a <Assistant_Red> Weakness </> effect to the soul's owner. If the target is not killed during the devouring effect, you will suffer backlash and lose Max HP. \n <Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained from the Tier 1 Earl rank ladder self-selection Sealed Artifact reward.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飒爽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得飒爽，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Brisk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Brisk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>无敌乱斗王</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>总计三届作为玩家排名前三"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Invincible Brawl King</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Rank in the top three as a player for a total of three seasons",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒・蝶舞花饰\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Dark Night Velvet/Butterfly Dance Flower Ornament\nIn the Midsummer Night's fairyland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of fairies, but also the fluttering of poetic hearts.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您的背包已满，我们为您将部分道具暂时存放于邮箱中，请及时在附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your inventory is full. We have temporarily stored some items in your mailbox. Please collect them from the attachments in time.</>",
