    ["{{player.name}}获得了“愚者”先生的恩赐——<Chat_Highlight>君临·冰晶</>！赞美祂！"] = "{{player.name}} received Mr. Fool’s blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Monarch: Ice Crystal</>! Praise Him!",
    ["　　……造物主从混沌中醒来，打破了幽暗，制造了第一缕光，自己则彻底融入宇宙，化身为万物。\n　　祂的身躯成为大地，成为星辰，祂的眼睛一只变为太阳，一只化作红月，祂的部分血液奔腾为大海与江河，滋润和孕育了生命……"] = "…The Creator woke from chaos, broke the darkness, and created the first ray of light, then completely merged into the universe, transforming into all things. \n His body became the earth and the stars, one of His eyes became the Blazing Sun, the other turned into the red moon, and parts of His blood surged into the seas and rivers, nourishing and nurturing life…",
    ["　　嘿，我亲爱的玩家！\n　　既然你要和“国王”玩选择游戏，不了解规则可不行。所以我亲自为你编写了这份终极傻瓜……哦不，是《终极扑克速成指南》！\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>五条</>：五张完全一样的扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>顺子</>：数字连续的五张扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>同花</>：花色相同的五张扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>同花顺</>：花色相同，且数字连续的五张扑克。\n\n　　祝你好运……或者，祝你能看穿“好运”背后的把戏！"] = "　　Hey, my dear player! \n　　Since you want to play a choice game with the 'King', you can't do it without knowing the rules. So I personally wrote this ultimate dummy... oh no, the 'Ultimate Poker Crash Course'! \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Five of a Kind </>: Five identical poker cards. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight </>: Five poker cards with consecutive numbers. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Flush </>: Five poker cards of the same suit. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight Flush </>: Five poker cards of the same suit with consecutive numbers. \n\n　　Good luck... or, I hope you can see through the tricks behind 'good luck'!",
